  <mods:abstract>4 pages in Tibetan with some Chines in the inner margins. Title changed to Ming kyang gsar 'gyur on May 1, 1955. From 1981 it becomes the Rnga ba gsar 'gyur (Aba bao) which continues today. From 19XX published in ལྷ་རྒྱལ་གླིང (lha rgyal gling); from 19xx in Barkam (འབར་ཁམས་'bar khams;  馬爾康 Maerkang).</mods:abstract>
